WEBVTT

00:07:27.983 --> 00:07:33.676
this new way of organizing intellectual authority,

00:07:33.676 --> 00:07:34.873
and religion.

00:07:34.873 --> 00:07:36.764
If you think about the 18th century, say,

00:07:36.764 --> 00:07:38.234
if you think about intellectual life

00:07:38.234 --> 00:07:40.590
before the late 19th century,

00:07:40.590 --> 00:07:43.760
anything you did, anything you thought about,

00:07:43.760 --> 00:07:46.490
whether it was the physical world,

00:07:46.490 --> 00:07:48.021
the human world,

00:07:48.021 --> 00:07:50.251
the natural world apart from the human world,

00:07:50.251 --> 00:07:52.218
or morality, anything you did

00:07:52.218 --> 00:07:53.894
would have been framed against the background

00:07:53.894 --> 00:07:56.357
of a set of assumptions that were religious,

00:07:56.357 --> 00:07:57.560
Christian assumptions.

00:07:57.560 --> 00:07:59.226
You couldn't give an account

00:07:59.226 --> 00:08:00.822
of the natural world